# Fixed line endings: every text file is stored and checked out with LF on every OS.
# The sealed SHA-256s in prereg_*.json were computed on the Windows working copies (some LF, some CRLF);
# scripts/verify_prereg.py checks them against the committed git blobs in both forms. See README "Verifying the seal".
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.xz binary
